    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "John Stith Pemberton (July 8, 1831 – August 16, 1888) was an American pharmacist, and is best known for being the founder of Coca-Cola. In May 1886 he developed an early version of a beverage that would later become world famous as Coca-Cola, but sold his rights to the drink shortly before his death.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.36227451416887924,
      "temperature": 0.36227451416887924,
