      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Coca wine is an alcoholic beverage combining wine with cocaine. One popular brand was \"Vin Mariani\", developed in 1863 by French-Corsican entrepreneur Angelo Mariani.",
